            'title' => 'Feast Days',
            'body' => '<p>1. The Solemnity of the Immaculate Conception of the Blessed Virgin Mary (8 December) shall be celebrated as the CWA General Feast Day. 2. The Memorial of Our Lady of the Rosary (7 October) shall be celebrated as the CWA General Day of Prayer. 3. The Solemnity of the Assumption of the Blessed Virgin Mary (15 August) and the Solemnity of the Immaculate Conception of the Blessed Virgin Mary (8 December) shall be the days for the dedication of new members. The Solemnity of the Immaculate Conception of the Blessed Virgin Mary shall be the day for renewal of dedication. 4. All levels of the association from Branches to Provinces shall take their names from any Marian title of their choice and may celebrate it as their Branch, Zonal, Divisional, Diocesan or Provincial Feast Day.</p>',
