            'body' => '<p>CATERING 1. The finance committee of the host Diocese shall be responsible for making all arrangements for catering and shall communicate same to all the levels concerned before the actual meeting takes place. 2. Each delegate shall be required to pay a registration fee charged by the finance/catering committee at least two (02) weeks before the official opening of the meeting or congress.</p>',
